WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:50.000
The VisTa vision. Nine intelligence disciplines connect observations, interpretation and action.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:01:40.000
Search and discoverability. Technical webpage checks are not the same as search traffic, rankings or search impressions.

00:01:40.000 --> 00:02:30.000
Live site intelligence. The verified Ambidexters HTML audit returned 89 out of 100, with a short title and absent raw HTML H1.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:03:20.000
Three website comparison. Three websites each scored 89, but their strengths and weaknesses differed.

00:03:20.000 --> 00:04:10.000
Content intelligence. VisTa analyses writing structure and supports browser-local editorial briefs.

00:04:10.000 --> 00:05:00.000
Trust and reputation. Record sources, identity claims and human-reviewed corrective actions.

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:50.000
Projects and execution. Audit findings can become local projects, evidence and accountable actions.

00:05:50.000 --> 00:06:40.000
Measurements and decisions. Source definitions, time windows and honest limitations matter more than pretty numbers.

00:06:40.000 --> 00:07:30.000
AI exposure and GEO. The manual observation ledger works; live automated sampling still requires API authorisation.

00:07:30.000 --> 00:08:20.000
Cloud foundation. Supabase verifies the organisation and manages authorised cloud workspace checkpoints.

00:08:20.000 --> 00:09:10.000
Founding plans. Basic, Standard and Platinum are proposed founding plans, not live subscriptions.

00:09:10.000 --> 00:10:00.000
First client engagement. Run a live audit, verify findings, agree a roadmap and activate authorised integrations.
